From 18e2bf5d2d6e8e60de392774454d7bfda6b431ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 20:57:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] feat(battle): authored 32x32 shaded slime + hero HP
 status window

The enemy is now true 32x32 art (curl tip, white pupil eyes, smile,
gleam, deep-blue shading and grounded base) in classic slime blue,
replacing the pixel-doubled 16x16 blob. DrawBattle also draws a small
DQ-style status window (rows 2-4) showing the hero's HP, composed from
the new LBL_HP fragment via ComposeHpRow; window frame tiles are now
exported as WIN_*_TILE constants for fixed small windows.
---
